## Third-party notices

### src/API/OpenAnimationReplacer-*.h / .cpp

These SDK files are copied from **Open Animation Replacer** by Ersh and its
distribution via **OpenAnimationReplacer-RaySense** by Smooth. Both are
distributed under permissive licenses (MIT or equivalent) and are intended to
be redistributed by plugins that use the OAR custom-condition API. Attribution
retained; see README.md credits.

### oar/Data/**/*.hkx (dummy animation files, NOT committed to this repository)

The OAR pack's placeholder .hkx files (when present in a release distribution,
not in this source repository) are copied from **Gulan0's walk_run_sprint - OAR**
as vanilla-preserving dummies. Users should replace them with their own
authored animations, or install Gulan0's mod as the animation source. These
files are excluded from the source repository via .gitignore.
